Blossom is a fork / derivative work. It builds directly on the Coteab
macro and inherits from the original Noteab biome macro.

Lineage:

  1. Noteab biome macro (NotWindyZ) — the original public biome macro
     this lineage grew from.
     https://github.com/NotWindyZ/Noteab-Macro

  2. Coteab macro (Vapure / xVapure) — the macro most Sol's RNG players
     run today, built on the Noteab foundation. This is the direct basis
     for Blossom.
     https://github.com/xVapure/Noteab-Macro

  3. Blossom (MaxxWasHere) — this fork. Adds its own UI and Python
     backend on top of the Coteab macro.
     https://github.com/MaxxWasHere/blossom

